  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Lightning Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/73/Gandalf_slays_Balrog.gif/revision/latest?cb=20220909061524\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Gandalf slays Balrog\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/73/Gandalf_slays_Balrog.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20220909061524\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/73/Gandalf_slays_Balrog.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20220909061524 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/73/Gandalf_slays_Balrog.gif/revision/latest?cb=20220909061524 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Gandalf slays Balrog\" width=\"270\" height=\"155\" data-image-key=\"Gandalf_slays_Balrog.gif\" data-image-name=\"Gandalf slays Balrog.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Gandalf (The Lord of the Rings) uses Glamdring to absorb lightning and use it to strike down the Balrog.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb lightning.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p> The power to <b>absorb lightning</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Manipulation\" title=\"Lightning Manipulation\">Lightning Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Absorption\" title=\"Electricity Absorption\">Electricity Absorption</a>.  \n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Manhwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Cartoons/Comics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cartoons/Comics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Literature\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Literature</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Movies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Movies</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Games\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Games</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Analysis_&amp;_Discussions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Analysis &amp; Discussions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLightning_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Lightning Siphoning/Drain/Drainage</li>\n<li>Lightning Energy Absorption</li>\n<li>Thunder/Lightning Thievery</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLightning_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can absorb lightning (atmospheric electrical phenomena), while removing it from the source (such as from the atmosphere in thunderclouds or ionized air), into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLightning_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Accumulation\" title=\"Electric Accumulation\">Electric Accumulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Capacitor\" title=\"Electric Capacitor\">Electric Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Energizing\" title=\"Electric Energizing\">Electric Energizing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electrical_Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Electrical Enhanced Condition\">Electrical Enhanced Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electrical_Immunity\" title=\"Electrical Immunity\">Electrical Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Consumption\" title=\"Electricity Consumption\">Electricity Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Empowerment\" title=\"Electricity Empowerment\">Electricity Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Infusion\" title=\"Electricity Infusion\">Electricity Infusion</a> - Absorb lightning and infuse it into weapons or beings.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionization\" title=\"Ionization\">Ionization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Redirection\" title=\"Lightning Redirection\">Lightning Redirection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Summoning\" title=\"Lightning Summoning\">Lightning Summoning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thunderstorm_Creation\" title=\"Thunderstorm Creation\">Thunderstorm Creation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLightning_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Absorption\" title=\"Electricity Absorption\">Electricity Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Manipulation\" title=\"Lightning Manipulation\">Lightning Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Storm_Manipulation\" title=\"Storm Manipulation\">Storm Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Weather_Manipulation\" title=\"Weather Manipulation\">Weather Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLightning_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>User may be limited to only absorbing lightning, unable to take in other forms of electricity.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLightning_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<h3><span id=\"Anime.2FManga.2FManhwa\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Anime/Manga/Manhwa\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Misaka Mikoto (<i>A Certain Magical Index</i>)</li>\n<li>Laxus Dreyer (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li>Natsu Dragneel (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li>Kirin (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li>Elexion (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li>Lambo (<i>Katekyo Hitman Reborn</i>)</li>\n<li>Nanashi (<i>Marchen Awakens Romance</i>)</li>\n<li>Galian (<i>Marchen Awakens Romance</i>)</li>\n<li>Denki Kaminari (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)</li>\n<li>Enel (<i>One Piece</i>)</li>\n<li>Zekrom (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li>\n<li>Zeraora (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li>\n<li>Nora Valkyrie (<i>RWBY</i>)</li>\n<li>Gilthunder (<i>Seven Deadly Sins</i>)</li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Cartoons.2FComics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cartoons/Comics\">Cartoons/Comics</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Black Lightning (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Godspeed (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Livewire (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Drago (<i>Jackie Chan Adventures</i>); via chi</li>\n<li>Electro (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Ororo Munroe/Storm (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Thor Odinson (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Literature\">Literature</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Gandalf (<i>The Lord of the Rings</i>)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Movies\">Movies</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Ares (<i>DC Universe</i>)</li>\n<li>Skrills (<i>How To Train Your Dragon</i>)</li>\n<li>Toothess (<i>How to Train Your Dragon</i>)</li>\n<li>Gruff (<i>Tinkerbell and the Neverbeast</i>)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Games\">Video Games</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Cole MacGrath (<i>InFamous</i>)</li>\n<li>Raiden Shogun (<i>Genshin Impact</i>)</li>\n<li>Ceratonoth (<i>Monster Hunter</i>); larger males only</li>\n<li>Nightwolf (<i>Mortal Kombat</i>)</li>\n<li>Raiden (<i>Mortal Kombat</i>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" dat